<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Talam year net at 59.33 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Talam year net at 59.33 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Jan 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  59.33   vs	  38.66</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	196.0    vs	  96.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   540.78   vs	 372.63</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   110.00   vs	  81.37</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less 13.81   vs  less  15.47</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     -     vs  less  14.62</p>
<p>    Total Div  (percent)     6.0    vs	   6.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Talam Corp Bhd is involved in property, financial services and construction businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
